              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सम्राट — samrāṭ — \"an emperor\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सम्राट के पास बहुत बड़ी सेना थी। samrāṭ ke pās bahut baṛī senā thī. The emperor had a very large army."
