          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सम्राट (samrāṭ) is Sanskrit samrāj, \"a universal ruler\" (Monier-Williams), whose nominative is samrāṭ: a king above kings."
            }
          ]
        },
